\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7.1}{\ignorespaces Every run of the calibration chain (stages 1--6) with its robust metrics. $\Delta I_{\mathrm {D}}(3\,\mathrm {V})$ is the simulated minus measured current at $V_{\mathrm {G}}=\SI {3}{V}$ in per cent. RMSE is the active log-current error (dec). $\mathit {SS}_{[-11,\,-10]}$ and $\mathit {SS}_{[-10,\,-9]}$ are the fixed-current slopes between $10^{-11}$ and $10^{-10}$ and between $10^{-10}$ and $10^{-9}\ensuremath {\,\mathrm {A}/\mu \mathrm {m}}$. Stage numbers follow \cref {fig:cal-workflow}; the stage labels in the run names are quoted. Units: V, mV/dec, \ensuremath {\,\mathrm {cm}^{2}/\mathrm {V\,s}}. The measured rows are from \file {data/experimental_clean.csv}; for 13.2~nm the slopes are raw (floor-subtracted: 91.8 and 118.8~mV/dec).}}{103}{table.caption.328}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7.2}{\ignorespaces Final converged calibration (DOS 384/192): measured versus simulated metrics. Simulated values are \texttt {run\_0038} ($\times 0.999983$), \texttt {run\_0039} ($\times 1.015074$) and \texttt {run\_0040} ($\times 1.020113$), i.e.\ exact rescalings to $\mu _{\mathrm {band}}=17.6897$ / 11.582 / 61.6046~\ensuremath {\,\mathrm {cm}^{2}/\mathrm {V\,s}}\ (S6 report, section 1.6). $^{*}$Measured 13.2~nm floor ($6.6\times 10^{-12}\ensuremath {\,\mathrm {A}/\mu \mathrm {m}}$) subtracted; raw values 136.1 ($\mathit {SS}_{[-11,\,-10]}$) and 160.0~mV/dec ($\mathit {SS}_{\mathrm {cc}}$). Active RMSE from \file {figures/MANIFEST.md}. gap $=V_{\mathrm {th,lin}}-V_{\mathrm {th,cc}}$; gap7 $=V(10^{-7}\ensuremath {\,\mathrm {A}/\mu \mathrm {m}})-V_{\mathrm {th,cc}}$.}}{106}{table.caption.330}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7.3}{\ignorespaces Every one-at-a-time, stage-pair and counterfactual run, with its measured effect. $\Delta $ = perturbed $-$ baseline. $\Delta I_{\mathrm {on}}$ at $V_{\mathrm {G}}=\SI {3}{V}$. RMSE: active log error of baseline $\rightarrow $ perturbed (dec). Action: R = rigid shift; S = subthreshold slope; G = turn-on delay (gap); I = current scale; -- = negligible.}}{108}{table.7.3}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7.4}{\ignorespaces Control matrix: measured leverage of each parameter on each transfer-curve feature (2.0~nm unless stated; from \cref {tab:cal-oat}). ``gap'' is $\Delta (V_{\mathrm {th,lin}}-V_{\mathrm {th,cc}})$. Entries below 5~mV, 1~mV/dec or 1~\% are marked ``0''.}}{110}{table.caption.340}%
